        "procedure": "The ligand dhampH5 (0.33 g, 1 mmol) was dissolved in 20 ml methanol, then 0.46 ml (4 mmol) triethylamine and Dy(H2O)6(NO3)3 (0.44 g, 1 mmol) were added. The solution was refluxed for 4.5 h under nitrogen. After cooling, the mixture was filtered and the filtrate was crystallized by diethyl-ether diffusion. Pale yellow crystals suitable for X-ray structure determination were obtained after one week.",
